<title>SWEDEN: Trading halts on Swedish OM exchange.</title>
<headline>Trading halts on Swedish OM exchange.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's futures and derivatives exchange OM stopped trading on Monday afternoon due to technical problems, an exchange spokesman said.</p>
<p>&quot;We have closed stopped trading until further notice on the grounds of technical problems,&quot; spokesman Robert Yngvesson told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
